<https://knowledge.c-innovationhub.com/dspa#priceCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The primary currency used in pricing. Platforms are assumed to use this as primary currency if currency conversions are used to display product pricing in different locations for various currencies. If the unit is revenue-sharing, then this attribute value MUST be percentage." .
<https://knowledge.c-innovationhub.com/dspa#priceCurrency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "price currency" .
